00:06:17.877 --> 00:06:19.345
I think it's

00:06:19.345 --> 00:06:21.881
just still a word from Scott last night.

00:06:21.914 --> 00:06:23.349
It's it's more of just like

00:06:24.317 --> 00:06:24.617
this.

00:06:24.617 --> 00:06:25.418
This whole thing is

00:06:25.418 --> 00:06:26.419
just floating on vibes

00:06:26.419 --> 00:06:28.388
to steal the word again. It really is.

00:06:28.388 --> 00:06:29.422
They want a fighter.

00:06:29.422 --> 00:06:30.289
They want somebody who's going

00:06:30.289 --> 00:06:32.692
to feel like they're in the ring.

00:06:32.692 --> 00:06:34.193
They're fighting for them.

00:06:34.193 --> 00:06:35.261
I don't think they want

00:06:35.261 --> 00:06:38.064
someone who is an X's and O's policy wonk

00:06:38.331 --> 00:06:39.298
who is a fighter.

00:06:39.298 --> 00:06:40.099
Chris Christie.

00:06:40.099 --> 00:06:42.101
Well, I was trying to see that.

00:06:42.101 --> 00:06:44.337
I usually don't bury the lead.

00:06:44.404 --> 00:06:44.771
I don't you

00:06:44.771 --> 00:06:45.171
know, Chris

00:06:45.171 --> 00:06:46.873
Christie is going to be somebody

00:06:46.873 --> 00:06:47.740
and I personally have

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:48.574
a conspiracy theory.

00:06:48.574 --> 00:06:49.942
I think Chris Christie has one job

00:06:49.942 --> 00:06:50.543
in this primary

00:06:50.543 --> 00:06:52.011
which is to take out Donald Trump.

00:06:52.011 --> 00:06:53.246
I think donors got together

00:06:53.246 --> 00:06:54.614
and said, you go do your Marco

00:06:54.614 --> 00:06:56.282
Rubio thing to Donald Trump.

00:06:56.282 --> 00:06:57.350
So we shall see.

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:58.584
I think Nikki Haley will be able

00:06:58.584 --> 00:06:59.585
to stand the test of time.

00:06:59.585 --> 00:07:01.020
But I just don't think it's her time.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:01.654
I.

00:07:01.654 --> 00:07:02.889
So there is a

00:07:02.889 --> 00:07:04.490
I guess that it might not be

